      "created_at": "2012-05-16T15:41:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That could be really fun - there would need to be some way to ensure balance, like a limit of no more than 4 or 5 heros per table (so if you want Visionary, you need to send Tempest, or whatever). Otherwise, you could end up with three high damage heros (Ra, AZ, and Fanatic) demolishing Baron Blade and six heros taking on Citizen Dawn with less pressure which wouldn’t be as fun.</p>",
