      "cooked": "<p>beevolant -  Good points.  I was thinking with each turn happening at the same time that if the heroes overloaded 1 area, the other one(s) would still be playing environment/villain turns and the victory condition that if all the heroes in that area were ko’d they would lose.</p>\n<p>Ronway - Another good point.  I would rule anyone leaving a table would be required to bring all their cards, so if a card was attached to someone beside your Hero it would be placed in your discard.</p>",
