      "created_at": "2012-05-17T03:59:14.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I smell a GenCon meet up event brewing…</p>\n<p>Yeah this looks awesome! I think with a little more polish it could really turn into something awesome! What would be even cooler is if their was some sort of mastermind behind all the villain attacks that the remaining heroes had to team up against after the regular villains were defeated (if anyone has played ToonTown Online I’m thinking something like the VP battle). Maybe this is something &gt;G could look into doing next year when they are (hopefully) not stressed with releasing a new expansion.</p>",
